    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Pediatric Brain Tumor Cohort\"\nexecute:\n  echo: false\n---\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n\n### Summary\n\nThe November 2026 oncology OMOP dataset (IRB76049) includes **2,792** unique patients who were 0 to 18 years old at their first qualifying brain tumor diagnosis (the index date).\n\n### Demographic Summary\n\nThe demographic summaries use the pediatric brain tumor cohort as the denominator, with one row per patient within each characteristic.\n\n::: {.panel-tabset}\n\n## Age at Index\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"plotly html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-769b508b88f0459c84d0\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-769b508b88f0459c84d0\">{\"x\":{\"visdat\":{\"76dc60d63b73\":[\"function () \",\"plotlyVisDat\"]},\"cur_data\":\"76dc60d63b73\",\"attrs\":{\"76dc60d63b73\":{\"x\":{},\"y\":{},\"orientation\":\"h\",\"marker\":{\"color\":\"#80CBC4\"},\"text\":{},\"textposition\":\"outside\",\"customdata\":{},\"hovertemplate\":\"<b>%{y}<\\/b><br>Patients: %{x:,}<br>% Patients: %{text}<extra><\\/extra>\",\"alpha_stroke\":1,\"sizes\":[10,100],\"spans\":[1,20],\"type\":\"bar\"}},\"layout\":{\"margin\":{\"b\":50,\"l\":200,\"t\":50,\"r\":50},\"title\":{\"text\":\"Unique Patients by Age at Index\",\"x\":0.050000000000000003},\"xaxis\":{\"domain\":[0,1],\"automargin\":true,\"title\":\"Unique Patients\"},\"yaxis\":{\"domain\":[0,1],\"automargin\":true,\"title\":\"\",\"tickfont\":{\"size\":10},\"type\":\"category\",\"categoryorder\":\"array\",\"categoryarray\":[\"15-18\",\"10-14\",\"5-9\",\"0-4\"]},\"hovermode\":\"closest\",\"showlegend\":false},\"source\":\"A\",\"config\":{\"modeBarButtonsToAdd\":[\"hoverclosest\",\"hovercompare\"],\"showSendToCloud\":false},\"data\":[{\"x\":[756,696,674,666],\"y\":[\"15-18\",\"5-9\",\"0-4\",\"10-14\"],\"orientation\":\"h\",\"marker\":{\"color\":\"#80CBC4\",\"line\":{\"color\":\"rgba(31,119,180,1